sequenceDiagram
    participant Human
    participant Ecosystem as Ecosystem Orchestrator
    participant System as System Orchestrator
    participant Graph as System Graph
    participant Queue as Work Order Queue
    participant Builder as Low-Cost Builder Agent
    participant Verifier as Independent Verifier
    participant Evidence as Evidence Plane

    Human->>Ecosystem: Submit change intent / incident / feature
    Ecosystem->>Graph: Query impacted systems, artifacts, constraints
    Graph-->>Ecosystem: Impact set + missing evidence + authorities
    Ecosystem->>System: Approve system-scoped plan
    System->>Queue: Emit typed micro work orders
    Queue->>Builder: File-scoped task with bounded context
    Builder->>Evidence: Emit patch, outputs, and execution evidence
    Evidence->>Verifier: Provide outputs and expected criteria
    Verifier->>Evidence: Emit pass/fail + defects + confidence
    Evidence->>Graph: Update graph patch + continuity patch
    Graph-->>System: New state, evidence refs, remaining blockers
    System-->>Ecosystem: Progress summary / escalation / complete
    Ecosystem-->>Human: Approval request or completion summary
